 "intro_zh": "阿拉尔市塔克拉玛干·三五九旅文化旅游区，是以三五九旅屯垦纪念馆为核心，展示兵团屯垦戍边红色文化以及接受爱国主义教育，了解阿拉尔市以及兵团建设成就的一个窗口，也是新疆建设兵团重要的红色旅游基地。其中纪念馆是为纪念1950年挺进新疆、解放新疆的新疆军区农业建设第一师而建。",
 "intro_en": "Aral (Uyghur: ئارال), also known as Alar (Chinese: 阿拉尔), is a sub-prefecture-level city surrounded by Aksu Prefecture in Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Region, China. Aral means \"island\" in Uyghur. Aral is the headquarter of the 1st Division of Xinjiang Production and Construction Corps and currently administered by the 1st Division. Aral implemented the \"division and city integration\" (师市合一, shī shì héyī) management system and shares the same leader group with the 1st Division.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
